<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil telecoms estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil telecoms estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers/Banco Patrimonio said it has raised its 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates on Brazilian telecoms Telesp, Telerj, Telepar and Telemig after the government announced a rate hike on April 3.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The Brazilian government approved a new aggressive tariff structure which exceeded our expectations,&quot; the brokerage said in a report.</p>
</text>
